the linux kernel, mainline 6.18 LTS series, built from kernel.org sources
upstream: https://www.kernel.org
license: GPL-2.0
ported to hdxp by: davy
 
installs /boot/vmlinuz-VERSION, config and System.map, plus modules in
/lib/modules. root fs, virtio disk/net and devtmpfs are built in, so no
initramfs is needed.
 
to customize: cd /hdxp/src/base-kernel-src/linux-VERSION, run make menuconfig,
then make and copy bzImage to /boot yourself.
